import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Privacy and cookies" description="What data Love You Forever collects, how cookies and advertising work, and your rights." path="/privacy/">
  <div class="wrap">
    <h1>Privacy and cookies</h1>
    <p class="meta">Last updated 7 October 2026</p>
    <h2>Who is responsible</h2>
    <p>Adeo Patapo, Patapo AI. Contact: <a href="mailto:adeopatapo@gmail.com">adeopatapo@gmail.com</a>.</p>
    <h2>What we collect</h2>
    <p>This site does not use accounts, forms, tracking pixels or analytics. Our hosting provider may keep standard server logs (such as IP address and page requested) for security and to keep the site running.</p>
    <h2>Cookies and advertising</h2>
    <p>The site works without cookies. If we switch on advertising, we will show a choice banner first. Ads load only if you click "Allow ads". When allowed, Google and its partners may set cookies or use similar technology to show and measure ads. You can change your mind by clearing this site's data in your browser. You can also manage Google's ad settings at <a href="https://adssettings.google.com" rel="noopener nofollow">adssettings.google.com</a>.</p>
    <p>We remember your banner choice in your browser's local storage, under the name lyf-consent. It never leaves your device.</p>
    <h2>Information about the women remembered here</h2>
    <p>Tributes use information already published by news outlets and other public sources, which are linked on each page. Relatives and other people with a legitimate interest can ask us to correct or remove a page at any time. See <a href="/corrections/">Corrections and removal</a>.</p>
    <h2>Your rights</h2>
    <p>Under the EU General Data Protection Regulation you may ask for access to, correction of or deletion of personal data we hold about you, and you may complain to the Italian data protection authority (Garante per la protezione dei dati personali).</p>
  </div>
</Base>
